sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Visitor
    participant P2 as Keycloak form
    participant P3 as Legal package
    participant P4 as Email action
    participant P5 as Mailbox
    participant P6 as Web callback
    P1->>P2: Open registration
    P2->>P3: Submit legal versions
    P3->>P4: Persist consent timestamp
    P4->>P5: Create unverified user
    P5->>P6: Send verify-email link
    P6-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
